📊 Project Overview

This project focuses on customer segmentation using Power BI to analyze customer behavior, demographics, and purchasing patterns. The goal is to identify distinct customer groups and support data-driven marketing and business decisions.

🎯 Objectives

Segment customers based on key metrics

Identify high-value and at-risk customers

Improve targeting, personalization, and retention strategies

🛠 Tools & Technologies

Power BI

DAX

Power Query

Excel / CSV Dataset

📂 Dataset

The dataset includes customer information such as:

Customer ID

Demographics

Purchase history

Frequency and monetary value

(Data used for analysis and visualization.)

📈 Key Features

Interactive dashboards

Customer segmentation visuals

KPIs for revenue, frequency, and engagement

Filters for dynamic analysis

📌 Insights Delivered

Clear identification of customer segments

Behavioral trends and patterns

Actionable insights for marketing and sales teams

🚀 How to Use

Open the .pbix file in Power BI Desktop

Refresh the data (if applicable)

Explore dashboards using filters and slicers
